@AdditionApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5262

### Save numbers
PUT {{AdditionApi_HostAddress}}/storage/numbers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": "[1,2,3]" }

### Get numbers
GET {{AdditionApi_HostAddress}}/storage/numbers
Accept: application/json

### Clear numbers
DELETE {{AdditionApi_HostAddress}}/storage/numbers

###
